    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Blue Monochromes (1955-1962)",
      "links": [],
      "level": 4
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Klein's discovery of the radiance of pure cobalt\nblue pigment (International Klein Blue) gave rise to his \"Blue\nPeriod\". The IKB paintings create a very intense visual sensation\nwith hallucinatory overtones. They pioneer a new art of \"pure\nlight\". At the same time, they function as conventional, figurative\nsigns: they depict \"cosmic space\".",
      "links": []
    },
